    "image_with_text_carousel_9ENYyE": {
      "type": "multirow",
      "blocks": {
        "image_with_text_6wzRPm": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Who_We_Are_1.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "WHO WE ARE",
            "text": "<p>To us, what you wear is more than just a necessity, it’s about attitude! We have taken the fighting American spirit and instilled it in everything we do. Our passion is to dress every American in Grunt Style from head to toe. With nearly 400 US Veterans and Patriots, our mission is to deliver the highest quality, most Patriotic apparel on the planet, straight to your front door. You will always be blown away by our products, our service, and our ability to ‘Merica! You do not have to be a veteran to wear Grunt Style, but you do have to love freedom, bacon, and whiskey. We provide more than just apparel; we bolster a lifestyle. We will continue to do our part in bringing patriotism to every home in America.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_fLR3JB": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/about-us-logo-history.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "LOGO HISTORY",
            "text": "<p>The history of the Grunt Style logo will help you better understand the significance of each individual aspect. The crossed rifles you see are 1792 Springfield Muskets, the weapons that won the war of 1812. These weapons helped to assure our independence as a nation. Looking at any Infantry guidon flag, the company logo (A/B/C Co.)  is always located where the ‘GS’ is within our own primary Grunt Style logo. The year 1776 is when our country was founded, our motto, “This We’ll Defend”, was the motto of the American Revolution. Each word is meaningful. “This” refers to the United States, the U. S. Constitution and liberty. “We’ll” references the army’s collective team efforts, and “Defend” refers to the primary function of the army as a defender of the nation, not an aggressor against others. Now “This We’ll Defend” is the official motto of the United States Army and Grunt Style.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_b7LYKk": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/about-us-assaulting-flag.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "ASSAULTING FLAG",
            "text": "<p>The <strong>Assaulting Flag</strong>  dates back to the Army's early history when both the cavalry and infantry units would charge ahead as the Stars and Stripes streamed back. As Americans, we are always moving forward. The stars of our Union will lead the way and the stripes of our original colonies will keep us grounded in our founding. This we'll defend!</p>",
            "button_label": "Check out this patriotic video",
            "button_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7iBJWWhL6c0&feature=youtu.be"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "image_with_text_6wzRPm",
        "image_with_text_fLR3JB",
        "image_with_text_b7LYKk"
      ],
