    "image_with_text_carousel_aEx8NA": {
      "type": "multirow",
      "blocks": {
        "image_with_text_jVQFHP": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/about-us-grunt-style-foundation-logo.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>Established in 2021, the Grunt Style Foundation is a national nonprofit organization committed to providing life changing resources and experiences to allow Service Members, Veterans and their Families thrive. At the Grunt Style Foundation, we believe that Mental Health and Wellness are paramount. No veteran should ever go without.  We are proud to assist with Military Transition & Sustainment, alleviating Food Insecurities and ending Veteran Homelessness. With the help of Grunt Style’s community and voice, we strive to serve those who so bravely served us.<strong>This We’ll Defend.</strong></p>",
            "button_label": "See How We Give Back",
            "button_link": "https://www.gruntstylefoundation.org/"
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_kr8aca": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Custom_Asset_2000x1499_Club_Dec_1_2024_Logo_Change_-_Evergreen_Assets-min.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>Club Grunt Style is more than a t-shirt subscription, it’s a community. Each month, Club members receive a unique t-shirt and sticker, designed exclusively for our Club members and included with membership. Members also get access to the Club Store and limited edition drops, free shipping and 10% off all Grunt Style orders, and a community that stands for the same values you do.</p>",
            "button_label": "Join Now",
            "button_link": "shopify://pages/club-grunt-style"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "image_with_text_jVQFHP",
        "image_with_text_kr8aca"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
        ".image-with-text__media img { object-fit: contain; }",
